핵심 수식:

`omega_ref = sign(error) * min(omega_max, sqrt(2 * alpha_brake * abs(error)))`

`alpha_cmd = clip(Kv * (omega_ref - omega), -alpha_max, alpha_max)`

`tau = I * alpha_cmd`

